## ⚠ Back up your data — this matters

**All data is stored in this browser on this computer only.**
Clearing browsing data, reinstalling the browser or changing
computer will lose every saved group.

**Take a backup weekly:**

Settings → Data Backup → **Download Backup**

Keep the file somewhere safe. To restore, use **Restore Backup**
and pick the file.

Settings → System Diagnostics warns you when storage is filling
up. Act on that warning — take a backup and delete old groups.

## Manager PIN

Settings → Manager PIN protects the Room Master from accidental
changes during a shift. It asks for the PIN again after every
reload, and there is a **Lock** button on the Room Master page.

This prevents accidents. It is **not** security — anyone with
browser developer tools can bypass it. Proper user accounts
arrive with the database version.

## If something stops working

1. Settings → **System Diagnostics** → **Run Diagnostics**
2. Read out what it says
3. If it reports problems, note them and contact support
4. Take a backup before trying anything else

